Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=38}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:18.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thing is, I got beef\Nwith the World Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.33,0:02:25.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're not just killing Stella,\Nthey're gonna kill {\i1}me{\i0}, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.17,0:02:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So rude, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.71,0:02:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I right?! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:30.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say it's rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Correct. It's very rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You paused!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:36.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But anyways, I got a plan\Nto turn this thing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.18,0:02:38.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:43.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,your job is to help mama kill some people\Nwho are annoying her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:45.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shut the Frontier Dome, so I want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:50.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}everyone in here dead, except me, Stella,\Nand the hostages underground. Say "roger" if you got all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:50.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 459.68 834.64 l 459.18 996.73 483.82 998.7 483.82 824.29 950.67 833.05 950.7 1045.17 976.06 1048.55 976.06 833.16 1439.92 845.67 1440.93 1069.86 1465.61 1071.21 1465.61 846.35 1601.52 852.77 1613.35 1145.91 371.41 1171.29 361.12 794.57)}{\q2}everyone in here dead, except me, Stella,\Nand the hostages underground. Say "roger" if you got all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:50.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 459.68 834.64 l 459.18 996.73 483.82 1070.7 950.7 1086.31 976.06 1048.55 976.06 833.16 1439.92 845.67 1440.93 1069.86 1465.61 1071.21 1465.61 846.35 1601.52 852.77 1613.35 1145.91 371.41 1171.29 361.12 794.57)}{\q2}everyone in here dead, except me, Stella,\Nand the hostages underground. Say "roger" if you got all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:50.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 976.06 1048.55 l 976.06 833.16 1439.92 845.67 1440.93 1069.86 1465.61 1071.21 1465.61 846.35 1601.52 852.77 1613.35 1145.91)}{\q2}everyone in here dead, except me, Stella,\Nand the hostages underground. Say "roger" if you got all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:51.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 976.06 1048.55 l 976.06 833.16 1439.92 845.67 1440.93 1069.86)}{\q2}everyone in here dead, except me, Stella,\Nand the hostages underground. Say "roger" if you got all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:52.69,Main-207+,All,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\pos(230,1053)}[ALL]\N– Roger!\N– Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:55.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sweetness. Now, when you start\Nkicking their butts,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:59.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,problem is, the Punks'll go, "Wait,\Nwho's ordering these things?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:00.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then they'll catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:05.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't beat 'em in a fair fight,\Nso I need a backup plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:07.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cue S-Snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.29,0:03:08.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta petrify me.\NAnd do it in front of them, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:12.55,Main-207+,S-Snake,0,0,0,,[S-SNAKE]\NRight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.55,0:03:15.13,Main-207+,S-Snake,0,0,0,,Then come back and undo it\Nwhen no one's looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:15.93,Main-207+,S-Snake,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:22.14,Main-207+,York,0,0,0,,{\q2}[YORK]\NOh! Before I forget, there's\Na couple places in the lab you shouldn't blow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is important,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1774)}so listen real carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:30.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready. Steady. Hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.73,0:03:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:55.42,Main-207+,Citizen A,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN A]\NEveryone on the ship! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:58.30,Main-207+,Citizen B,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN B]\NWe need\Nto get off Egghead, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:27.10,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,[KID]\NEveryone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:28.41,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:30.63,Main-207+,Kid Pirates,0,0,0,,[KID PIRATES]\NYeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid Pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only a fool would oppose our chief.\NYou're gonna die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:42.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:45.22,Main-207+,Pirate A,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A]\NNo! Not the frog thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:47.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get lost or {\i1}croak{\i0}, {\i1}ribbit{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:52.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! What he said!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:54.40,Main-207+,Pirate B,0,0,0,,[PIRATE B]\NPops, your dentures!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:57.36,Main-207+,Pururu,0,0,0,,[PURURU]\NAway with you, fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:58.78,Main-207+,Pururu,0,0,0,,I do not like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:05:03.82,Main-207+,Pururu,0,0,0,,You will never reach Chiefy! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:06.58,Main-207+,Pururu,0,0,0,,Now! Or I shall be cross with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:08.50,Main-207+,Pirate N,0,0,0,,[PIRATE N]\NYou are so brave, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:13.27,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,Is Red Hair mocking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:15.92,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,{\i1}These{\i0} can't be his real allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do these clowns even survive\Nin the New World?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:22.59,Main-207+,Killer,0,0,0,,[KILLER]\NI get what you mean,\Nbut he's got a few famous names in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:24.22,Main-207+,Killer,0,0,0,,Don't get sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:28.06,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,Whether they're weak\Nor strong, I'm not here to show mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:36.32,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NAre we ready to set sail?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:37.19,Main-207+,Red-Haired Pirate D,0,0,0,,[RED-HAIRED PIRATE D]\NHey, Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:39.94,Main-207+,Red-Haired Pirate D,0,0,0,,The other crews went out to stop Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:41.40,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NThen tell them to retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:43.49,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,I don't want them dying for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.49,0:05:45.03,Main-207+,Pirates,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES]\N– Whoa, whoa, whoa!\N– Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.03,0:05:46.78,Main-207+,Pirates,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Wait, wait, wait!\N– Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.46,Main-207+,Pirates,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES]\N– C'mon, Chief! What are you tryin' to pull?\N– C'mon, Chief! What are you tryin' to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:54.71,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NI think I should be asking you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:57.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll handle this!\NThey won't lay a damn finger on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:05:58.92,Main-207+,Both,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– That's right!\N– That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.17,0:06:02.93,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys. For the offer, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:05.43,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,But seriously, stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.43,0:06:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,here. Just leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:15.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least let us fight beside you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:25.16,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's enough! Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:26.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:28.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, c'mon! You can't be takin' off already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.41,0:06:30.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you just got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:32.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've hardly had a chance to chat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:33.41,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NWe got places to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.83,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,I was just stoppin' here for a quick drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:39.05,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but let me go, guys. C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:44.22,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NA big shot showed up\Nbecause I bummed around too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:46.30,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NAlright, one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:48.10,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,Tell the ships to retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:51.52,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,You know I'd take you, but I can't be seen\Nwith a bunch of weaklings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:56.60,Main-207+,Pirate I,0,0,0,,[PIRATE I]\NTell us how you really feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:58.90,Main-207+,Oli,0,0,0,,[OLI]\NWhat does it matter if we're weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:01.11,Main-207+,Oli,0,0,0,,We're invincible as long as we have your flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:02.44,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NDon't get too comfortable, Oli.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:05.53,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,My flag can't scare off old age for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:09.41,Main-207+,Oli,0,0,0,,[OLI]\NHa-ha! Do you hear the way\Nhe talks to me? No respect for his elders!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:11.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Boss! Your fans can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:13.41,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NOh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:16.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh, we'll wrap this up in two shakes\Nof a drumstick. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:19.46,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,{\q2}Don't get cocky. Kid's worth three billion, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:22.96,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,They grow up fast these days.\NYou gotta be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:29.72,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,{\q2}[SHANKS]\NBut they had a hell of a fight in Wano.\NDoes it look like their wounds have healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:30.51,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.39,0:07:33.02,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,They're in tip-top shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:35.14,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,Definitely ready for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.39,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,That's good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:39.69,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,What about Blackbeard? Any updates yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:43.65,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,No. All we know is that he left Pirate Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:46.61,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,I was so sure he'd show up\Nin the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:48.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hongo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:52.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready. Here's your intel on Kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:55.45,Main-207+,Red-Haired Pirate E,0,0,0,,[RED-HAIRED PIRATE E]\NWe're so proud\Nof you, turning your homework in on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:57.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough! We got a ship to load!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:01.29,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NI see. So he's from the South Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:04.42,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,And it looks like he's gone\Non quite the rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:09.64,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,[KID]\NHow many ships are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:11.14,Main-207+,Killer,0,0,0,,[KILLER]\NNine total.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.10,0:08:15.10,Main-207+,Killer,0,0,0,,There are some faces\NI've seen on wanted posters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:36.08,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,[KID]\NI don't care\Nwho we're up against! Let them come!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:43.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll wipe them all out in ten seconds flat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:54.39,Main-207+,Pirate K,0,0,0,,[PIRATE K]\NHe's pulling\Nthe ship! Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.39,0:08:55.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:59.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you under my feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:02.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going straight to the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:06.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I won't let anyone get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.91,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,See you in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:53.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,773)}C'mon, Red Hair! The next one's for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:56.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.41,0:09:59.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell the fleet to spread out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:00.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see somethin', Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dorry! Brogy! Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:05.29,Main-207+,Dorry & Broggy,0,0,0,,{\q2}[DORRY, BROGGY]\N– We were born ready!\N– We were born ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:08.92,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NHard to port!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.64,0:10:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too much power. He'll kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:27.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess he saw a future he didn't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See you in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:40.79,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NShould've expected this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:58.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You kept me waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.60,0:11:03.14,Main-207+,Shanks,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[SHANKS]\NDivine Departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:10.42,Main-207+,Killer,0,0,0,,[KILLER]\NPartner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:12.88,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,[KID]\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:15.38,Main-207+,Killer,0,0,0,,[KILLER]\NWon't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:16.80,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,[KID]\NThat's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:22.22,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,[KID]\NJust look at how far we've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:25.06,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,Only one Road Poneglyph left to take,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:27.35,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,then we set sail for the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:30.10,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,You hear that? Kaido, Big Mom, Red Hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:33.07,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,Ha! All the old-timers couldn't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:34.69,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,They can't keep up with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:37.53,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,Our crew's made it to the front of the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:40.74,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,I will be King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one can stop {\i1}me{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.45,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,Killer, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.45,0:12:47.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You laughing at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:18.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.11,0:13:18.94,Main-207+,Papas,0,0,0,,[PAPAS]\NDamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:21.32,Main-207+,Papas,0,0,0,,Killer got hurt trying to protect him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:32.71,Main-207+,Heat,0,0,0,,[HEAT]\NNo! Stop, Red Hair! We surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:33.71,Main-207+,Heat,0,0,0,,Please, have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:36.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're begging you, please don't kill our boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.09,0:13:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Emma. Bring them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? – Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:50.10,Main-207+,Heat,0,0,0,,[HEAT]\NThese are our Road Poneglyphs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:51.39,Main-207+,Heat,0,0,0,,All the ones we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:54.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can have them, just please let us live!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Chief! Time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.22,0:14:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:28.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:36.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.73,0:14:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:53.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, little ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:56.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you know what happens when you point\Na gun at someone's home, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You better be ready\Nfor them to start shooting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(462,1053)\fad(150,150)}Hakoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:50.69,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThus, the battle\Nat Elbaph ended. Eustass "Captain" Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:55.25,Narrator-207+,Narrator,0,0,0,,with a bounty of three billion berries,\Nfell alongside his crew, the Kid Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:16:00.65,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It was a massacre.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=39}===============================DIALOGUE============================
